  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "應用總體計量經濟學",
    "sub_ename": "APPLIED MACROECONOMETRICS",
    "describe_ch": "在課堂中學生們將會學習如何操作計量軟體，並搭配時間序列資料，應用於文獻上所常見到的總體實證模型。其中，課程會先簡要地介紹幾個計量軟體的操作，而後續的課程會圍繞在幾個重要的總體實證模型之實證應用。",
    "describe_eh": "In this course, students will learn how to incorporate the time series data into the econometrics software and apply it to the well-known empirical models in the field of macroeconomics. In particular, I will briefly introduce several econometrics software first. Then the course will be organized into the empirical application in several of important macroeconomic models.",
    "pre_subname": "ECON3008計量經濟學",
    "pre_sub_id3": "ECON3008",
    "pre_sub_ename": "ECON3008 ECONOMETRICS",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "總體實證模型之理論分析",
      "describe_en": "Comprehending the theoretical knowledge of macroeconometric models."
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "應用計量軟體於資料分析、參數估計與統計推論",
      "describe_en": "Applying the econometric software to data analysis, estimation of the parameters and statistical inference."
    },
    {
      "seq": 3,
      "describe_ch": "具備口頭報告研究結果之能力",
      "describe_en": "Possessing the ability of oral presenting the research results"
    }
  ],
